  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>399</x>
      <y>189</y>
      <w>210</w>
      <h>245</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Coordinate Translattion Locate X,Y
of FirstScreen coord fora world row,col

Need to account for row and col
headers

Row -&gt; Y
(Row - 1) * (Row_Height + 1) + 1
(1 - 1) + (2 + 1) + 1 = 1
(2 - 1) + (2 + 1) + 1 = 4
(3 - 1) + (2 + 1) + 1 = 7

Col -&gt; X
(Col - 1) * (Col_Width + 1) + 1
(1 - 1) * (5 + 1) = 1
(2 - 1) * (5 + 1) = 6
(3 - 1) * (5 + 1) = 11
</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
